  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_park"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "7:16 P.M.    天氣/晴\n龍門中央公園，鱗魚丸小攤"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您點的魚丸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦哦，這口感，彈性，真不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不愧是百大民間美食攻略推薦的店家！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "客人喜歡就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哎，你不覺得那個店主有點可怕嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是說啊，兇神惡煞的不講，明明在賣魚丸，為什麼桌上要放把菜刀啦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且我看攻略上說，店主是個號稱魚丸之神的老伯伯才對啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，該不會是黑社會搶了攤子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？客人，還有什麼需要嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒、沒事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......最近的客人真奇怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還不是因為你的表情太凶了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有你幹嘛穿著這身就來顧攤？你就不能為董阿伯的名聲考慮一下嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是你喔，打工結束了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算是吧。事務所那邊說上次在你這兒賒了帳，多少來著？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "三十二塊六，零頭就算了吧。要嘗嘗嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "突然幹嘛，我可沒帶多餘的零錢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就當是慰問品收下吧，畢竟你們總是照顧我生意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那，我就不客氣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吃是好吃，但這不是阿伯的攤子嗎？借花獻佛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幹嘛總是要挑我刺，我會自掏腰包的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就好。不過你的手藝的確有進步，要是那群傢伙像你這樣認真對待自己的工作該多好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您好，一份魚丸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，好的，客人請稍等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係，我不趕時間。這裡能遠遠看到江景，很難得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "香味真不錯，這本美食攻略還是挺可靠的嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......久等了。這是找零。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "客人請慢走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "槐琥？你在看什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，那位小姐總讓人覺得有點怪怪的......薩科塔人會長角的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安魂夜化妝吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不太像，算了，無端揣測他人可不是什麼好習慣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接下來你打算幹什麼？回事務所？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "回去複習，過兩天有考試。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在安魂節當天還要念書？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安魂節是恭送靈魂的節日，現代社會對於節日的定義基本就是消費，敬謝不敏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "重點是，我可沒那麼多薪水，倒不如說我更希望績點高一點，還能拿到獎學金。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，好吧，倒像是你的作風......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是那些傢伙和社會脫節太久了。可不要把我看作那種人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，時間應該還有很多，下一家該去哪裡呢？讓我看看，唔，這附近還有......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的龍門市民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂！交流道上發生什麼了？是車禍嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "散步的龍門市民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好像不是簡單的車禍，去不去湊個熱鬧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閒散的龍門市民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又打架喔？湊熱鬧算我一個！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們這群瘋子，離我遠點啊啊啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唔，這麼快？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來要提前上工了呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_motorway"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "疼......我，被甩出來了......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幸好欄杆夠結實，不然衝出交流道鐵定完蛋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，幫我一把！把我拉出去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們要逃了，各位！我們得立刻追上去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔唔唔，可這個，安全氣囊，太，擠了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別亂動！我的老夥計要被壓扁了！喂！可頌！扣你工資喔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我、我動不了呀，德克薩斯姐壓著我的腿了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘁，那就只好讓我一個人來——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拜松！等等！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "圍觀的人越來越多，現在放跑他們就很難抓到他們了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快拉呀，那個豐蹄小子衝過來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "盡力了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別想跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好、好重——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有狙擊手！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，德克薩斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（沒有命中，敵人打歪了？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（不對，目標是燃料箱——！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，怎麼回事？誰在攻擊那個豐蹄小子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別說了！那隻狼也衝過來了，趕緊拉我出來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，我聞到什麼味道？是不是燃料漏了？你手腳快點！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......兄弟，保重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你——！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "糟糕，平衡被——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖，來不及了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
